{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020810/extras/0ee367bbb42c97043622d90408ce8e71.avif?t=1765112418\" width=1536 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020810/extras/1e246d49fde6152a5cec7b477ed715b2.poster.avif?t=1765112418\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020810/extras/1e246d49fde6152a5cec7b477ed715b2.webm?t=1765112418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020810/extras/1e246d49fde6152a5cec7b477ed715b2.mp4?t=1765112418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Time Left is a 3D capital-ship rogue-like that blends tactical decision-making with elements of space sim and full 360 combat. Every run is different and every event will uniquely respond to your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020810/extras/20f16cfb8917bf8d43b83594ae847972.avif?t=1765112418\" width=1536 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020810/extras/684b6384e4250a65ffeed6212ba8f6d7.poster.avif?t=1765112418\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020810/extras/684b6384e4250a65ffeed6212ba8f6d7.webm?t=1765112418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020810/extras/684b6384e4250a65ffeed6212ba8f6d7.mp4?t=1765112418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time Combat with Pause </strong> <br>Issue precise orders at full burn or drop into tactical pause to line up broadsides, prioritize targets, and triage damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Is Survival</strong><br>Hot-swap power between engines, shields, weapons, and support systems on the fly. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drones: Your Extra Hands</strong><br>Deploy attack, defense, and repair drones to tip the balance mid-fight, patch hull breaches, and keep critical systems online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shielding &amp; System Damage</strong><br>Manage  shields, fires, and failing modules as incoming salvos chew through your defenses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020810/extras/4a4c2cd46b90df8a004657f05e189370.avif?t=1765112418\" width=1536 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every encounter plays out differently.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons, drones, sensors, and power setup can change what options you have\u2014revealing safer solutions, or bigger risks for better rewards. Some choices bank favors you can cash in later; others create consequences that follow you across the sector. Swap modules between jumps and the same event can resolve in entirely new ways. Build for combat, rescue, or cunning\u2014and the galaxy responds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020810/extras/783d2d657e59e9192e3723c376e7ab72.avif?t=1765112418\" width=1536 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020810/extras/77589e022aa36640fa47e18f94a1ba6c.poster.avif?t=1765112418\" width=1170 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020810/extras/77589e022aa36640fa47e18f94a1ba6c.webm?t=1765112418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020810/extras/77589e022aa36640fa47e18f94a1ba6c.mp4?t=1765112418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship Progression</strong><br>Salvage, barter, and retrofit. Stack augmentations, unlock new hulls with distinct playstyles, and build the flagship that fits your tactics.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4020810?t=1765112418","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020810/f2d861e65c7d1957b1a61a51ba2eb958face2d23/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765112418","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020810/e9c6ad78eacde79644061d4cf05a80d792e45ef7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765112418","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020810/e9c6ad78eacde79644061d4cf05a80d792e45ef7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765112418","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020810/extras/0ee367bbb42c97043622d90408ce8e71.avif?t=1765112418\" width=1536 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_i